this command is used to check the mysql image default user: 
>> docker iamge inspect mysql:8.4 --format'{{ .Config.User }}'

this command is used to inspect the image's database directory ownership
>> docker run --rm --entrypoint sh mysql:8.4 -c 'id; ls -ld /var/lib/mysql'

  check the mysql user uid and gid or the user obtainer from teh first command
>> docker run --rm --entrypoint sh mysql:8.4 -c 'id mysql'

  Then Check the data directory's numeric ownership
  >> docker run --rm --entrypoint sh mysql:8.4 -c 'stat -c "%u:%g %a %n" /var/lib/mysql'
